#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:1
msgid "DEC, IPHS, GENERIC, Ports, and Reaction Structure"
msgstr "DEC、IPHS、GENERIC、端口与反应结构"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:3
msgid "Structural governance lifecycle"
msgstr "结构治理生命周期"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:5
msgid "A constitutive rate formula specifies process speed under local conditions; structural governance additionally specifies discrete spatial support, conserved elemental ledgers, conjugate thermodynamic efforts, port power exchange, and overflow residual routing (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapters 8, 9, 12, and 13). In RELIC, Discrete Exterior Calculus (DEC), Irreversible Port-Hamiltonian System (IPHS), and General Equation for Non-Equilibrium Reversible-Irreversible Coupling (GENERIC) operators augment the single runtime lifecycle without introducing a second simulator, state manager, or registry:"
msgstr "本构速率公式规定局地条件下的过程速率；结构治理在此基础上进一步规定离散空间支撑域、守恒元素账本、共轭热力学势（effort）、端口功率交换以及溢出残差路由（书稿《生态学分析方法》第 8、9、12 及 13 章）。在可重组生态系统集成耦合库（Recomposable Ecosystem Library for Integrated Coupling, RELIC）中，离散外微分（Discrete Exterior Calculus, DEC）、互连端口哈密顿系统（Interconnected Port-Hamiltonian System, IPHS）与广义非平衡可逆-不可逆耦合方程（General Equation for Non-Equilibrium Reversible-Irreversible Coupling, GENERIC）算子直接在单一运行时生命周期之上增强结构约束，不额外引入第二套模拟器、状态管理器或注册表："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:15
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{Scientific ABC}\n"
"\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\text{Canonical Bridge}\n"
"\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\texttt{FunctorBase}\n"
"\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\texttt{ParameterManager} + \\texttt{StateManager}\n"
"\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\text{DEC / IPHS / GraphIR Audit}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\text{Scientific ABC}\n"
"\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\text{Canonical Bridge}\n"
"\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\texttt{FunctorBase}\n"
"\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\texttt{ParameterManager} + \\texttt{StateManager}\n"
"\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\text{DEC / IPHS / GraphIR Audit}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:27
msgid "Every Graph Intermediate Representation (`GraphIR`, `relic.orchestration.graph_ir`) compilation pass (`compile_graph` in `relic.orchestration.compiler`) emits a normalized 13-key `report.audit` summary (`syntax_ok`, `semantic_ok`, `assertion_ok`, `assertion_audit`, `conservation_audit`, `port_matching_audit`, `overflow_routing_audit`, `equivalence_certificate_audit`, `reaction_network_audit`, `integration_plan_audit`, `global_compile_audit`, `validation_error_count`, `validation_warning_count`). Software wiring nullspace vectors (`topology_signature.conservation_vectors` in `relic.orchestration.topology_algebra`) summarize topological incidence $\\ker(\\mathbf{B}^{\\mathsf{T}})$ and never substitute for physical mass or energy conservation committed through `StateManager`."
msgstr "每次图中间表示（`GraphIR`，`relic.orchestration.graph_ir`）编译遍（`relic.orchestration.compiler` 中的 `compile_graph`）均输出规范化的 13 键 `report.audit` 审计摘要（`syntax_ok`、`semantic_ok`、`assertion_ok`、`assertion_audit`、`conservation_audit`、`port_matching_audit`、`overflow_routing_audit`、`equivalence_certificate_audit`、`reaction_network_audit`、`integration_plan_audit`、`global_compile_audit`、`validation_error_count`、`validation_warning_count`）。软件接线零空间向量（`relic.orchestration.topology_algebra` 中的 `topology_signature.conservation_vectors`）仅概括拓扑关联核空间 $\\ker(\\mathbf{B}^{\\mathsf{T}})$，绝不替代经由 `StateManager` 提交的物理质量守恒或能量守恒。"

