msgstr "上边缘正合性与斯托克斯（Stokes）配对"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:63
msgid "The discrete exterior derivative $D_k: C^k(K) \\rightarrow C^{k+1}(K)$ is the transpose of the chain boundary incidence matrix, $D_k = \\partial_{k+1}^{\\mathsf{T}}$, satisfying the exact topological nilpotency identity (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 8):"
msgstr "离散外导数 $D_k: C^k(K) \\rightarrow C^{k+1}(K)$ 为链边缘关联矩阵的转置 $D_k = \\partial_{k+1}^{\\mathsf{T}}$，满足精确的拓扑幂零恒等式（书稿《生态学分析方法》第 8 章）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:68
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"D_{k+1} D_k = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\langle D_k \\alpha,\\; c \\rangle = \\langle \\alpha,\\; \\partial_{k+1} c \\rangle.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"D_{k+1} D_k = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\langle D_k \\alpha,\\; c \\rangle = \\langle \\alpha,\\; \\partial_{k+1} c \\rangle.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:74
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`cochain_complex_check` (`relic.validation.framework.rules.dec_complex`) verifies $D_{k+1} D_k = 0$ against `validation.dec_complex.cochain_residual_tolerance` (strict validation also requires integer incidence entries, $D_0 \\mathbf{1} = 0$, and boundary subcomplex closure). `typed_stokes_audit` (`relic.computation.operators.dec.complex`) evaluates the discrete Stokes pairing on supplied cochain/chain vectors as a finite point check."
msgstr "`cochain_complex_check`（`relic.validation.framework.rules.dec_complex`）对照 `validation.dec_complex.cochain_residual_tolerance` 校验 $D_{k+1} D_k = 0$（严格校验同时要求关联矩阵元素为整数、满足 $D_0 \\mathbf{1} = 0$ 且边界子复形闭合）。`typed_stokes_audit`（`relic.computation.operators.dec.complex`）在给定的上链/链向量上计算离散斯托克斯配对，作为有限点检验。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:81
msgid "Linear chain maps (`LinearChainMap`)"
msgstr "线性链映射（`LinearChainMap`）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:83
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`LinearChainMap` (`relic.computation.operators.dec.chain_map`) represents a unit-aware linear operator $M \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n_t \\times n_s}$ between declared `source` and `target` `CochainSpaceSpec` spaces with positive unit-conversion factor $u > 0$. Construction (`__post_init__`) enforces four fail-closed checks:"
msgstr "`LinearChainMap`（`relic.computation.operators.dec.chain_map`）表示在已声明的 `source` 与 `target` `CochainSpaceSpec` 上链空间之间带有正单位换算因子 $u > 0$ 的单位感知线性算子 $M \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n_t \\times n_s}$。构造阶段（`__post_init__`）强制执行四项故障封闭检查："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:88
msgid "**Two-dimensional matrix rank**: `matrix.ndim == 2`;"
msgstr "**二维矩阵阶数**：`matrix.ndim == 2`；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:89
msgid "**Exact degree-of-freedom shape match**: `tuple(matrix.shape) == (target.n_dofs, source.n_dofs)`;"
msgstr "**自由度形状精确匹配**：`tuple(matrix.shape) == (target.n_dofs, source.n_dofs)`；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:90
msgid "**Finite entries**: `torch.isfinite(matrix).all()`; and"
msgstr "**矩阵元素全部有限**：`torch.isfinite(matrix).all()`；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:91
msgid "**Strictly positive unit scale**: `unit_factor > 0.0`."
msgstr "**单位缩放因子严格为正**：`unit_factor > 0.0`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:93
msgid "Application, composition, unit-adjusted ledger preservation (`preserves_ledger` against `validation.iphs.chain_map_ledger_tolerance`), perturbation error bounding (`error_bound`), and operator distance (`distance`, `close_within`) satisfy:"
msgstr "算子作用、复合运算、经单位换算的守恒账本保持（`preserves_ledger`，对照 `validation.iphs.chain_map_ledger_tolerance`）、扰动误差上界（`error_bound`）以及算子距离（`distance`、`close_within`）满足："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:98
msgid ""
"\n"
"y = u M x,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\max_{i,j}\\lvert \\left(C_t (u M) - C_s\\right)_{ij} \\rvert \\le \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{cm}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\lVert u M \\delta x \\rVert_2 \\le \\lVert u M \\rVert_2\\,\\lVert \\delta x \\rVert_2,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"y = u M x,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\max_{i,j}\\lvert \\left(C_t (u M) - C_s\\right)_{ij} \\rvert \\le \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{cm}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\lVert u M \\delta x \\rVert_2 \\le \\lVert u M \\rVert_2\\,\\lVert \\delta x \\rVert_2,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:106
msgid ""
"\n"
"d(M_1, M_2) = \\lVert u_1 M_1 - u_2 M_2 \\rVert_2.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"d(M_1, M_2) = \\lVert u_1 M_1 - u_2 M_2 \\rVert_2.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:110
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Exact equality `equals` ($d = 0$ with identical spaces and `unit_factor`) is an equivalence relation; `close_within` ($d(M_1, M_2) \\le \\varepsilon$) is reflexive and symmetric without transitivity. Coboundary commutation $P_{k+1} D_k^{(a)} = D_k^{(b)} P_k$ is audited separately by `chain_map_check` (`relic.validation.framework.rules.chain_map`)."
msgstr "精确相等 `equals`（空间与 `unit_factor` 一致且 $d = 0$）构成等价关系；容差邻近 `close_within`（$d(M_1, M_2) \\le \\varepsilon$）满足自反性与对称性，不具传递性。上边缘交换关系 $P_{k+1} D_k^{(a)} = D_k^{(b)} P_k$ 由 `chain_map_check`（`relic.validation.framework.rules.chain_map`）独立审计。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:116
msgid "Hodge star and constitutive metrics (`HodgeStarSpec`)"
msgstr "霍奇星算子与本构度量（`HodgeStarSpec`）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:118
msgid "`HodgeStarSpec` (`relic.computation.operators.dec.hodge`) maps primal $k$-cochains to dual $(n - k)$-cochains, $\\star_k: C^k(K) \\rightarrow C^{n-k}(K^\\ast)$, inducing the discrete inner product $\\langle \\alpha, \\beta \\rangle_k = \\alpha^{\\mathsf{T}} H_k \\beta$ via matrix $H_k$ backed by `ParameterManager` `parameter_keys` and `metric_keys`. Calling `HodgeStarSpec.validate()` and `hodge_psd_check` (`relic.validation.framework.rules.hodge`) verifies compatible domain/codomain spaces, finite entries, and role-specific definiteness:"
msgstr "`HodgeStarSpec`（`relic.computation.operators.dec.hodge`）将原始 $k$-上链映射为对偶 $(n - k)$-上链 $\\star_k: C^k(K) \\rightarrow C^{n-k}(K^\\ast)$，并经由受 `ParameterManager` 中 `parameter_keys` 与 `metric_keys` 支撑的矩阵 $H_k$ 诱导离散内积 $\\langle \\alpha, \\beta \\rangle_k = \\alpha^{\\mathsf{T}} H_k \\beta$。调用 `HodgeStarSpec.validate()` 与 `hodge_psd_check`（`relic.validation.framework.rules.hodge`）可校验定义域/陪域空间相容性、元素有限性以及按角色区分的正定/半正定性质："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:127
msgid ""
"\n"
"H_k = H_k^{\\mathsf{T}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"z^{\\mathsf{T}} H_k z > 0 \\quad \\forall z \\neq 0 \\;\\; (\\text{metric SPD}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"z^{\\mathsf{T}} H_k z \\ge 0 \\;\\text{with}\\; H_k K = 0,\\; \\dim K = \\operatorname{nullity}(H_k) \\;\\; (\\text{material PSD}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"H_k = H_k^{\\mathsf{T}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"z^{\\mathsf{T}} H_k z > 0 \\quad \\forall z \\neq 0 \\;\\; (\\text{metric SPD}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"z^{\\mathsf{T}} H_k z \\ge 0 \\;\\text{with}\\; H_k K = 0,\\; \\dim K = \\operatorname{nullity}(H_k) \\;\\; (\\text{material PSD}).\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:135
msgid "A singular material operator must supply its complete linearly independent `kernel_basis` $K$ and never substitutes for an invertible metric Hodge star. With storage cochain $x$ and flux cochain $f$, semi-discrete conservative transport $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -D^{\\mathsf{T}} f + s + b$ lowers into governed `StateManager` updates via `typed_cochain_delta_to_update_item` (`relic.computation.operators.dec.adapters`)."
msgstr "奇异本构材料算子必须提供完整的线性无关核空间基 `kernel_basis` $K$，绝不可替代可逆度量霍奇星算子。给定存储上链 $x$ 与通量上链 $f$，半离散守恒输运方程 $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -D^{\\mathsf{T}} f + s + b$ 通过 `typed_cochain_delta_to_update_item`（`relic.computation.operators.dec.adapters`）降阶为受控的 `StateManager` 更新记录。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:142
msgid "Irreversible port-Hamiltonian and GENERIC lowering"
msgstr "不可逆端口哈密顿与 GENERIC 降阶"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:144
msgid "`IPHSStructureSpec`, `PortSpecIPHS`, `assemble_iphs_structure`, `advance_reaction_network`, and `poisson_jacobi_residual` (`relic.computation.operators.iphs`) separate dissipative port-Hamiltonian (`dissipative_ph`) realizations from GENERIC / metriplectic (`generic`) realizations without mixing energy resistance $R_h$ and entropy mobility $M_h$ (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapters 9, 12, and 13)."
msgstr "`IPHSStructureSpec`、`PortSpecIPHS`、`assemble_iphs_structure`、`advance_reaction_network` 与 `poisson_jacobi_residual`（`relic.computation.operators.iphs`）将耗散端口哈密顿系统（dissipative Port-Hamiltonian, dPH；`dissipative_ph`）实现同 GENERIC / 度量辛（`generic`）实现严格分离，绝不混用能量阻尼矩阵 $R_h$ 与熵迁移率矩阵 $M_h$（书稿《生态学分析方法》第 9、12 及 13 章）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:151
msgid "Dissipative port-Hamiltonian (`dissipative_ph`) realization"
msgstr "耗散端口哈密顿（`dissipative_ph`）实现"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:153
msgid "For storage functional $H(x)$ with conjugate effort $e_H = \\nabla_x H(x)$, port input $u_h$, port matrix $G_h$, and conjugate output $y_h = G_h^{\\mathsf{T}} e_H$, the canonical `dissipative_ph` drift (`M_h = 0`) evaluated by `IPHSStructureSpec.canonical_drift` is:"
msgstr "对于存储泛函 $H(x)$ 及其共轭势 $e_H = \\nabla_x H(x)$、端口输入 $u_h$、端口矩阵 $G_h$ 与共轭输出 $y_h = G_h^{\\mathsf{T}} e_H$，由 `IPHSStructureSpec.canonical_drift` 求值的规范 `dissipative_ph` 漂移项（`M_h = 0`）为："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:158
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t} = (J_h - R_h) e_H + G_h u_h + N_h r_h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"J_h^{\\mathsf{T}} = -J_h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"R_h = R_h^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t} = (J_h - R_h) e_H + G_h u_h + N_h r_h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"J_h^{\\mathsf{T}} = -J_h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"R_h = R_h^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:166
msgid "Because $e_H^{\\mathsf{T}} J_h e_H = 0$, closed reaction-free trajectories satisfy $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -e_H^{\\mathsf{T}} R_h e_H \\le 0$, and open trajectories satisfy $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -e_H^{\\mathsf{T}} R_h e_H + y_h^{\\mathsf{T}} u_h \\le y_h^{\\mathsf{T}} u_h$."
msgstr "由于狄拉克结构反对称互连项满足 $e_H^{\\mathsf{T}} J_h e_H = 0$，封闭无反应轨迹满足瑞利耗散不等式 $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -e_H^{\\mathsf{T}} R_h e_H \\le 0$，开放轨迹满足供给率不等式 $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}H}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -e_H^{\\mathsf{T}} R_h e_H + y_h^{\\mathsf{T}} u_h \\le y_h^{\\mathsf{T}} u_h$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:170
msgid "GENERIC / metriplectic (`generic`) realization and Jacobi bases"
msgstr "GENERIC / 度量辛（`generic`）实现与雅可比基"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:172
msgid "For total energy $E(x)$ ($e_E = \\nabla_x E$) and entropy $S(x)$ ($e_S = \\nabla_x S$), the canonical `generic` metriplectic drift (`R_h = 0`) evaluated by `IPHSStructureSpec.canonical_drift` and audited via `IPHSStructureSpec.validate` is:"
msgstr "对于总能量 $E(x)$（$e_E = \\nabla_x E$）与熵 $S(x)$（$e_S = \\nabla_x S$），由 `IPHSStructureSpec.canonical_drift` 求值并经 `IPHSStructureSpec.validate` 审计的规范 `generic` 度量辛漂移项（`R_h = 0`）为："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:177
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t} = J_h(x)\\,e_E + M_h(x)\\,e_S + G_h u_h + N_h r_h,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t} = J_h(x)\\,e_E + M_h(x)\\,e_S + G_h u_h + N_h r_h,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:181
msgid "subject to skew-symmetry, positive semidefiniteness, and mutual degeneracy:"
msgstr "受反对称性、半正定性及互退化条件约束："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:183
msgid ""
"\n"
"J_h^{\\mathsf{T}} = -J_h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"M_h = M_h^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"J_h e_S = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"M_h e_E = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"e_S^{\\mathsf{T}} M_h e_S \\ge 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"J_h^{\\mathsf{T}} = -J_h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"M_h = M_h^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"J_h e_S = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"M_h e_E = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"e_S^{\\mathsf{T}} M_h e_S \\ge 0.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:195
msgid "For an isolated reaction-free system ($u_h = 0$, $r_h = 0$), energy is conserved ($\\frac{\\mathrm{d}E}{\\mathrm{d}t} = e_E^{\\mathsf{T}} J_h e_E + e_E^{\\mathsf{T}} M_h e_S = 0$) and entropy increases monotonically ($\\frac{\\mathrm{d}S}{\\mathrm{d}t} = e_S^{\\mathsf{T}} M_h e_S \\ge 0$). Note that RELIC lowers GENERIC/metriplectic tendencies through `IPHSStructureSpec.canonical_drift` and `advance_reaction_network` (`[I]`); no separate standalone metriplectic time-integrator class is exposed (`[N]`)."
msgstr "对于孤立无反应系统（$u_h = 0$，$r_h = 0$），总能量严格守恒（$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}E}{\\mathrm{d}t} = e_E^{\\mathsf{T}} J_h e_E + e_E^{\\mathsf{T}} M_h e_S = 0$），熵单调不减（$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}S}{\\mathrm{d}t} = e_S^{\\mathsf{T}} M_h e_S \\ge 0$）。RELIC 通过 `IPHSStructureSpec.canonical_drift` 与 `advance_reaction_network` 对 GENERIC/度量辛倾向项进行降阶（`[I]`），未暴露独立的度量辛时间积分器类（`[N]`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:203
msgid "Skew-symmetry of $J_h$ (carrying the Poisson operator $L_h$) does not imply the Jacobi identity. `IPHSStructureSpec` admits three executable `poisson_operator` bases audited against `validation.iphs.jacobi_tolerance`:"
msgstr "$J_h$（承载泊松算子 $L_h$）的反对称性不足以蕴含雅可比恒等式。`IPHSStructureSpec` 支持三类对照 `validation.iphs.jacobi_tolerance` 审计的可执行 `poisson_operator` 基："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:207
msgid "`\"zero_field\"`: $L(x) = 0$ identically (`canonical_zero_field`); all live certified production processes use zero reversible Poisson fields."
msgstr "`\"zero_field\"`：恒有 $L(x) = 0$（`canonical_zero_field`）；现行全部已认证生产过程均采用零可逆泊松场。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:209
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`\"constant_field\"`: constant skew matrix $L$ with $\\partial_l L_{ij} = 0$, so the Jacobi residual vanishes identically (`constant_field_exact`)."
msgstr "`\"constant_field\"`：满足 $\\partial_l L_{ij} = 0$ 的常值反对称矩阵 $L$，其雅可比残差恒为零（`constant_field_exact`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:211
msgid "`\"state_field\"`: importable callable $L(x)$ audited by autograd via `poisson_jacobi_residual` over declared `poisson_domain` state samples and at bound Level 5 runtime points (`sampled_domain_jacobi_residual`):"
msgstr "`\"state_field\"`：可导入的可调用对象 $L(x)$，通过自动微分经由 `poisson_jacobi_residual` 在已声明的 `poisson_domain` 状态样本集及绑定的等级 5 运行时点上进行审计（`sampled_domain_jacobi_residual`）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:215
msgid ""
"\n"
"R_{ijk}(x)\n"
"= \\sum_{l} \\left(\n"
"L_{il}\\frac{\\partial L_{jk}}{\\partial x_l}\n"
"+ L_{jl}\\frac{\\partial L_{ki}}{\\partial x_l}\n"
"+ L_{kl}\\frac{\\partial L_{ij}}{\\partial x_l}\n"
"\\right).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"R_{ijk}(x)\n"
"= \\sum_{l} \\left(\n"
"L_{il}\\frac{\\partial L_{jk}}{\\partial x_l}\n"
"+ L_{jl}\\frac{\\partial L_{ki}}{\\partial x_l}\n"
"+ L_{kl}\\frac{\\partial L_{ij}}{\\partial x_l}\n"
"\\right).\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:224
msgid "Static `matrix_snapshot` tensors carry no derivative information and fail closed for state-dependent Jacobi claims (`[N]`)."
msgstr "静态 `matrix_snapshot` 张量不携带导数信息，针对状态依赖的雅可比恒等式声明将按故障封闭拒绝（`[N]`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:227
msgid "Reaction networks, open-system routing, and port interconnection"
msgstr "反应网络、开放系统路由与端口互连"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:229
msgid "`advance_reaction_network` (`relic.computation.operators.iphs`) and `reaction_network_check` (`relic.validation.framework.rules.reaction_network`) govern stoichiometric kinetics $\\dot{x}_{\\mathrm{rxn}} = N_h r_h$ ($N_h \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n_s \\times n_r}$, $r_h \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n_r}$):"
msgstr "`advance_reaction_network`（`relic.computation.operators.iphs`）与 `reaction_network_check`（`relic.validation.framework.rules.reaction_network`）共同治理化学计量动力学 $\\dot{x}_{\\mathrm{rxn}} = N_h r_h$（$N_h \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n_s \\times n_r}$，$r_h \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n_r}$）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:233
msgid "**Independent vs absorbed reaction representation**: Within one `IPHSStructureSpec`, reactions either appear explicitly as $+N_h r_h$ (requiring $e_H^{\\mathsf{T}} N_h r_h = 0$ for total energy or $\\le 0$ for free energy) or are absorbed into the dissipative operator ($N_h r_h = -R_h e_H$ in `dissipative_ph` or $N_h r_h = M_h e_S$ in `generic`, omitting $+N_h r_h$ so rates are never double-counted)."
msgstr "**独立反应表示与吸收式反应表示**：在同一个 `IPHSStructureSpec` 中，化学反应要么以显式项 $+N_h r_h$ 给出（对总能量要求 $e_H^{\\mathsf{T}} N_h r_h = 0$，对自由能要求 $\\le 0$），要么吸收至耗散算子内部（在 `dissipative_ph` 中满足 $N_h r_h = -R_h e_H$，在 `generic` 中满足 $N_h r_h = M_h e_S$，此时省略 $+N_h r_h$ 以杜绝速率重复计入）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:239
msgid "**Closed stoichiometry and physical affinity power**: Internal conservation requires $C_h N_h = 0$ (and optional charge neutrality $z_h^{\\mathsf{T}} N_h = 0$). With chemical potentials $\\mu$, reaction affinity $\\mathcal{A} = -N_h^{\\mathsf{T}} \\mu$ satisfies dissipative power non-negativity $P_{\\mathrm{rxn}} = \\mathcal{A}^{\\mathsf{T}} r_h \\ge 0$; division by positive temperature $\\sigma_{\\mathrm{rxn}} = \\mathcal{A}^{\\mathsf{T}} r_h / T$ yields entropy production only when an executable $T > 0$ and thermodynamic closure are bound."
msgstr "**化学计量闭合与物理亲和势功率**：内部守恒要求满足 $C_h N_h = 0$（以及可选的电中性条件 $z_h^{\\mathsf{T}} N_h = 0$）。给定化学势 $\\mu$，反应亲和势 $\\mathcal{A} = -N_h^{\\mathsf{T}} \\mu$ 满足耗散功率非负条件 $P_{\\mathrm{rxn}} = \\mathcal{A}^{\\mathsf{T}} r_h \\ge 0$；仅当绑定了可执行正温度 $T > 0$ 与热力学本构闭合时，除以温度所得的 $\\sigma_{\\mathrm{rxn}} = \\mathcal{A}^{\\mathsf{T}} r_h / T$ 才构成熵产生率。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:247
msgid "**Open-system exchange and overflow routing**: Open systems keep internal stoichiometry closed ($C_h N_h = 0$) and route external exchange separately as $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t} = N_h r_h + q_{\\mathrm{open}}$ with $C_h q_{\\mathrm{open}} = \\dot{\\ell}_{\\mathrm{open}}$ typed via `OpenSystemRoute` (`\"port\"`, `\"boundary_export\"`, `\"managed_export\"`, `\"diagnostic_residual\"`, or `\"observation\"`). Any bounds-clipping residual $r_{\\mathrm{clip}} = (x + \\Delta x) - \\operatorname{clip}(x + \\Delta x, x_{\\min}, x_{\\max})$ must declare a valid route in `overflow_routing_check` (`\"storage\"`, `\"boundary_outflow\"`, `\"managed_export\"`, `\"diagnostic_residual\"`, or `\"rejected_step\"`)."
msgstr "**开放系统交换与溢出路由**：开放系统保持内部化学计量闭合（$C_h N_h = 0$），并将外部交换单独路由为 $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t} = N_h r_h + q_{\\mathrm{open}}$，其中 $C_h q_{\\mathrm{open}} = \\dot{\\ell}_{\\mathrm{open}}$ 通过 `OpenSystemRoute`（`\"port\"`、`\"boundary_export\"`、`\"managed_export\"`、`\"diagnostic_residual\"` 或 `\"observation\"`）执行类型化声明。任何边界截断残差 $r_{\\mathrm{clip}} = (x + \\Delta x) - \\operatorname{clip}(x + \\Delta x, x_{\\min}, x_{\\max})$ 均须在 `overflow_routing_check` 中声明合法路由（`\"storage\"`、`\"boundary_outflow\"`、`\"managed_export\"`、`\"diagnostic_residual\"` 或 `\"rejected_step\"`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:257
msgid "**Port matching vs runtime port power**: `port_matching_check` (`relic.validation.framework.rules.port_matching`) verifies static port declarations (effort/flow units $[P] = [e][f]$, dimensions, orientations, and signed incidence balance $\\sum_i s_i w_i = 0$). Skew interconnection $C = -C^{\\mathsf{T}}$ induces $J_{\\mathrm{port}} = G_h C G_h^{\\mathsf{T}}$, and passive feedback $u_{\\mathrm{int}} = -D y_h$ ($D \\succeq 0$) induces $R_{\\mathrm{port}} = G_h D G_h^{\\mathsf{T}}$ in `dissipative_ph` only (never added directly to GENERIC $M_h$). Actual power balance $P_a + P_b \\le 0$ is a runtime evaluation (`port_power_units_check` / `feedback_power_ledger`), distinct from static wiring checks."
msgstr "**静态端口匹配与运行时端口功率**：`port_matching_check`（`relic.validation.framework.rules.port_matching`）校验静态端口声明（势/流单位关系 $[P] = [e][f]$、维数、定向以及带符号关联平衡 $\\sum_i s_i w_i = 0$）。反对称互连 $C = -C^{\\mathsf{T}}$ 诱导端口互连矩阵 $J_{\\mathrm{port}} = G_h C G_h^{\\mathsf{T}}$，无源反馈 $u_{\\mathrm{int}} = -D y_h$（$D \\succeq 0$）仅在 `dissipative_ph` 模式下诱导端口阻尼 $R_{\\mathrm{port}} = G_h D G_h^{\\mathsf{T}}$（绝不直接叠加至 GENERIC 迁移率矩阵 $M_h$）。实际功率平衡 $P_a + P_b \\le 0$ 属于运行时求值（`port_power_units_check` / `feedback_power_ledger`），同静态接线检查相区分。"

