#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/dec_iphs_generic.md:291
msgid "Both strict certificates (`Level 4` and `Level 5`) audit the continuous-time canonical drift at the pre-step runtime state and require a matching `governed_execution` witness from a committed `FunctorBase.__call__` step (without a witness, `IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` reports `process_bound_runtime_unavailable`). The primary certificates of `FickianDiffusion` and `ChemistryFunctor` remain `Level 3`, and Level 4/5 runtime points with open external port columns remain unimplemented (`[N]`)."
msgstr "两份严格证书（`Level 4` 与 `Level 5`）均在步前运行时状态处审计连续时间规范漂移项，并要求来自已提交 `FunctorBase.__call__` 执行步的匹配 `governed_execution` 见证记录（若无见证记录，`IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` 将报告 `process_bound_runtime_unavailable`）。`FickianDiffusion` 与 `ChemistryFunctor` 的主类证书保持为 `Level 3`，带开放外部端口列的等级 4/5 运行时点尚未实现（`[N]`）。"

